    "group": "Pteraxii Skystalkers",
    "summary": "In your Shooting phase, once this unit has shot, and provided it is outside Engagement Range of every enemy unit, it may either move up to 6\" as a Normal move, or move up to 12\" as a Normal move if every one of its models finishes wholly inside 6\" of one of your ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE units. If it makes either move, it cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn.",
